  m_text: 'Red test buttons (end the day, open closed shops) and visible hitboxes.

    Test
    items are added the next time a new game starts.

    TRAFFIC_LINE_DEV (own switch):
    ship lanes + edit panel, mouse free (Tab: look around).

    CREDITS: add or
